{"4273150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galaxy Defender Elite 3D", "steam_appid": 4273150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Defender Elite 3D arcade space  game  makes you feel like you are playing a classic game in 3D. If you are a big fan of arcade space  games and fighting alien swarms then Galaxy Defender is the perfect game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic game with a new setting: Galaxy Defender Elite 3D sets you on fire with intense space combat. You will face a lot of evil enemies and deal with many unique bosses. As Earth's last hope you are the last defense, protect humanity from alien swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Track your progress on the game leader board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gorgeous Pixel graphic similar to old school games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Super-easy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273150/extras/07e47c3dd63a0fd8daaad29ad65c276d.poster.avif?t=1767986131\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273150/extras/07e47c3dd63a0fd8daaad29ad65c276d.webm?t=1767986131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273150/extras/07e47c3dd63a0fd8daaad29ad65c276d.mp4?t=1767986131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strong and varying swarms of alien enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sixteen space and planet levels to fight through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4273150/extras/5d11eb3839c4bc6d86f802c